# Kuro I/O library. Input remains explicit: callers declare the destination.

Action KuroReadText Value;
    Return Value;
Done.

Action KuroReadFile Path;
    Call ReadFile Path;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroWriteFile Path, Content;
    Call WriteFile Path, Content;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroFileExists Path;
    Call FileExists Path;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroListDirectory Path;
    Call ListDirectory Path;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroNow;
    Call Now;
    Return @_;
Done.
